<title>FINLAND: Finnish prelim Feb trade surplus FIM 3.0 bln -NCB.</title>
<headline>Finnish prelim Feb trade surplus FIM 3.0 bln -NCB.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's trade surplus fell to 3.0 billion markka in February from 3.8 billion in January and from 3.6 billion in February last year, the National Customs Board (NCB) said in statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said the figures were preliminary.</p>
<p>The value of exports fell five percent year-on-year in February and the value of imports fell one percent, NCB said.</p>
</text>
